    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d33">

                <pb facs="0097" n="23" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp02v01/pg23"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72119/557</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Francis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Petrograd</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-04-14T20:00:00+02:31">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 14, 1917, 8 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received April 15, 3 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1192. Your 1308, 12th. Just had thoroughly satisfactory talk with Miliukov who
                    absolutely certain no possibility of separate peace. Says Socialists here have
                    never so suggested but that most radical faction is advocating revolution in
                    Central Empires, deposing ruling monarchs thereof, and thereafter negotiating
                    universal socialistic peace. Government, however, not perturbed thereby as it
                    daily becomes stronger, soldiers returning to regiments and passing resolutions
                    calling upon workingmen to return to making munitions. Latter becoming more
                    reasonable and much less emphatic in their demands.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
